<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00728">
	<title>Operating order</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>Remote Operation operates in the following order:</p>
		<ol>
			<li>
				<p>Getting ready to remotely move forward and backward</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Remotely moving forward and backward</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</conbody>
</concept>